  "fixtureFormatVersion": 1,
  "description": "Differential reconciliation fixtures. Every case runs through the upstream composition (restoreElements + reconcileElements) and through the adapter's reconcileRemoteElements; the full semantic results must be identical, and the summarized result must equal `expected`. Regenerate expected values only after auditing an upstream upgrade (RECONCILE_FIXTURE_PRINT=1 prints actuals).",
