      "name": "ordering-sparse-remote-batch-merges-by-index",
      "description": "A scene-ordered remote batch that skips local elements merges at the right fractional positions. Remote batches must stay in scene (index) order: upstream restoreElements index-repairs any batch whose members are out of order, exactly like the upstream Portal, which always broadcasts in scene order.",
